@baseUrl = http://localhost:8084

### Save a new draft
# @name create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drafts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Town opens free summer swimming school",
  "content": "First draft: the town will open a free swimming school for children this summer.",
  "author": "Christian"
}

### Get the draft created above
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drafts/{{create.response.body.$.id}}

### Update it
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/drafts/{{create.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Town opens free summer swimming school for all children",
  "content": "Second draft: more details about the swimming school.",
  "author": "Christian"
}

### All drafts by an author (newest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drafts?author=Christian

### Delete it
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/drafts/{{create.response.body.$.id}}

### A draft that doesn't exist: 404, and a Warning in the logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drafts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
